---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Warranty & Returns — CYPH/1" description="CYPH/1 warranty, returns and refund information.">
  <Header/>
  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Customer care</p>
      <h1>Warranty &amp; Returns</h1>
      <p>This page explains the current CYPH/1 returns, refunds and warranty position. CYPH/1 is still in pre-launch, so product-specific commercial warranty terms and final fulfilment arrangements will be published before orders are opened.</p>

      <h2>Your statutory rights</h2>
      <p>Nothing on this page is intended to limit the rights you have under applicable UK consumer law. Any final CYPH/1 returns or warranty policy will operate alongside those rights.</p>

      <h2>Returns and cancellations</h2>
      <p>Detailed return instructions, eligibility conditions and the return address will be confirmed before CYPH/1 accepts customer orders. Customers should contact us before returning a product so that we can provide the appropriate instructions and reference.</p>

      <h2>Refunds</h2>
      <p>Where a refund is due, CYPH/1 will confirm it separately once the refund has been completed through the payment process. The time taken for the funds to appear can then depend on the customer's bank or payment provider.</p>

      <h2>Warranty and product support</h2>
      <p>The final CYPH/1 commercial warranty period and product-specific coverage are not yet approved. We will publish these terms before launch rather than state a warranty period that has not been finalised.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>For help with an order, return, refund or product support query, email <a href="mailto:info@cyph1.co.uk">info@cyph1.co.uk</a>.</p>
      <address>CYPH1 LTD<br/>Unit 171614, PO Box 7169<br/>Poole, BH15 9EL<br/>United Kingdom</address>
      <p>Company number 17455968.</p>
      <p>Last updated: 5 October 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer/>
</BaseLayout>
